(1) VST SUPPORT

Please do not distribute Nebula Bulldog with VST support under the package
name "nebulabulldog" (or any case-variant on that). Use some other name such
as "nebulabulldogvst", "NebulaBulldogVST", "nebulabulldog-vst" etc. In the
near future, work will be done to make it possible to share as much as
possible of the packaging.

(2) STANDARD TEMPLATES

The templates in ./templates are intended for installation in
$prefix/share/nebulabulldog/templates.
